WEBVTT

00:00.430 --> 00:04.850
<b>Action over words, in this moment?</b>

00:01.490 --> 00:04.510
Action over words, in this moment?

00:06.690 --> 00:08.360
Bravo!

00:11.630 --> 00:13.340
Akutagawa!

00:13.340 --> 00:14.900
You fool!

00:14.900 --> 00:16.210
Get out of here!

00:28.950 --> 00:32.380
So his plan from the beginning was 
to give his ally a chance to escape.

00:35.430 --> 00:37.920
The VIP escape submersible.

00:37.920 --> 00:41.770
He must have cut that hole in the floor 
to let the wereboy escape on that.

00:42.180 --> 00:44.330
I could still catch it if
 I started swimming now

00:44.330 --> 00:46.600
Fukuchi-dono! Fukuchi-dono!

00:46.900 --> 00:49.030
It really is you! Samurai Fukuchi-dono!

00:51.350 --> 00:54.860
Boswellian to Yokohama Coastal Security.

00:55.250 --> 00:57.810
Fukuchi-dono is fighting 
the enemy aboard the ship.

00:57.810 --> 00:58.910
Requesting backup.

00:59.360 --> 01:01.360
<i>He's in contact with the land.</i>

01:01.880 --> 01:03.350
Well done, men.

01:03.350 --> 01:05.370
Please put out the fire in the engine room.

01:05.370 --> 01:07.320
The fire has been extinguished.

01:07.320 --> 01:10.260
We've also reported our 
situation to headquarters.

01:10.260 --> 01:15.290
I was nearly strangled to death 
by a terrorist on the loose.

01:15.290 --> 01:18.150
I won't be satisfied until 
he's taught a lesson.

01:18.150 --> 01:21.830
I'll have to apologize, then...

01:23.430 --> 01:25.350
I've already struck him down.

01:25.350 --> 01:27.440
No, that's fine.

01:27.710 --> 01:30.310
<i>I've wasted time talking to the guard.</i>

01:30.790 --> 01:34.150
<i>The submersible is already beyond the 
reach of my sword's space traversal.</i>

01:34.670 --> 01:37.170
<i>Should I cut into the past and kill the guard?</i>

01:38.000 --> 01:38.830
<i>No...</i>

01:39.210 --> 01:42.420
<i>He said he's already reported 
the situation to headquarters.</i>

01:42.420 --> 01:44.600
<i>They may realize my methods if I do that.</i>

01:45.840 --> 01:47.210
<i>I have no choice.</i>

01:48.710 --> 01:52.020
One of the terrorists 
escaped on a submersible.

01:52.020 --> 01:56.130
Instruct Coastal Security 
to follow the beacon.

01:56.130 --> 01:56.750
Yes, sir.

01:57.330 --> 01:59.200
<i>Damn tigerboy...</i>

01:59.200 --> 02:02.050
<i>You're lucky those guards 
happened to come by.</i>

02:02.740 --> 02:03.760
<i>Not a problem.</i>

02:04.320 --> 02:07.720
<i>In six more days, I'll have 
no reason to hide anything.</i>

02:13.480 --> 02:14.510
I'm sorry.

02:15.070 --> 02:18.380
I ought to have done more 
for you for sparing me.

03:52.960 --> 03:57.000
<i>After I escaped from the 
submersible and swam to shore,</i>

03:57.410 --> 04:02.030
<i>Ango-san took me in. He made me understand
all that had happened aboard the ship.</i>

04:03.020 --> 04:05.560
<i>Why Akutagawa let me flee...</i>

04:06.430 --> 04:11.740
<i>What would have happened if he'd gone 
against his vow not to kill and killed the guard...</i>

04:12.180 --> 04:16.840
<i>I would also have died, never having a chance
to tell the outside who Fukuchi truly is.</i>

04:17.410 --> 04:19.690
Sorry to interrupt while you're dead...

04:20.180 --> 04:22.070
But I still have work for you.

04:22.590 --> 04:25.070
Allow me to introduce you to my friend.

04:25.540 --> 04:28.170
The final member of the Decay of Angels.

04:28.610 --> 04:30.020
A calamity upon the world.

04:30.910 --> 04:32.400
The undead king.

04:32.960 --> 04:34.650
Bram-kun.

04:38.380 --> 04:40.160
My old enemy...

04:41.040 --> 04:44.770
How many years has it been 
since my last awakening?

04:44.770 --> 04:46.520
Just two weeks.

04:46.740 --> 04:49.770
What? A mere two weeks?

04:49.770 --> 04:55.100
That's only enough time for the stars 
to travel from Capricorn to Aquarius.

04:55.100 --> 04:57.700
Close my coffin so that I may sleep.

04:57.700 --> 04:59.730
I told you...

05:00.110 --> 05:02.740
The next time you awakened, you would be busy.

05:02.740 --> 05:03.780
I don't care.

05:03.780 --> 05:06.740
My slumber is important.

05:06.740 --> 05:09.240
Curses be upon the insolent masses.

05:10.770 --> 05:12.500
You curse me?

05:13.440 --> 05:15.510
Sorry, but that's not happening.

05:17.530 --> 05:20.670
Immortal Count Bram,
 lord of Northern Europe.

05:21.180 --> 05:26.410
A former human whose cells were altered by 
a special ability, rendering you a vampire.

05:27.080 --> 05:31.930
One of the ten tragedies that 
ruined the peoples of long ago.

05:31.930 --> 05:34.840
I don't remember having such a nickname.

05:34.840 --> 05:36.730
Don't be so pissy.

05:36.730 --> 05:38.560
We're on the same side now.

05:39.050 --> 05:41.160
I've prepared a meal for you.

05:41.160 --> 05:42.270
A meal?

05:42.870 --> 05:43.960
Him.

05:48.330 --> 05:49.510
I refuse.

05:49.510 --> 05:50.640
Why?

05:50.640 --> 05:56.650
On the day eight years ago when I was 
called a pillar of the ten tragedies,

05:56.650 --> 05:59.490
I decided that I would no 
longer transform any kin.

05:59.880 --> 06:01.720
I will not take in his blood.

06:02.010 --> 06:04.700
If you want to raze the world,
do it yourself.

06:07.650 --> 06:11.960
Refuse, and I'll fry your brain 
with this holy cross sword.

06:12.990 --> 06:15.970
I can't place a curse upon you.

06:16.260 --> 06:18.890
You are, yourself, a curse.

06:21.360 --> 06:24.360
<b>Episode 54</b>

06:32.130 --> 06:33.620
Akutagawa-senpai!

06:34.190 --> 06:35.490
Where were you?

06:35.930 --> 06:38.190
I'm so confused!

06:38.190 --> 06:41.800
We just had your funeral!

06:43.070 --> 06:45.170
I finally understand...

06:45.910 --> 06:48.750
I can't let things end before 
I tell you how I feel.

06:49.210 --> 06:51.270
Senpai, please, listen to me.

06:51.270 --> 06:52.130
I...

06:53.920 --> 06:57.050
Wait, Senpai, I'm not ready.

07:05.070 --> 07:06.320
Tachihara-kun.

07:06.810 --> 07:08.540
Please fill us in.

07:08.850 --> 07:10.050
Right.

07:10.520 --> 07:13.450
But how should I even begin to explain?

07:14.480 --> 07:19.690
After I returned to the Port Mafia,
I was called to action.

07:20.350 --> 07:24.050
But when I arrived,
I saw Higuchi attack Gin.

07:25.850 --> 07:27.910
None of it made sense to me.

07:28.910 --> 07:31.130
Hirotsu made a move first.

07:31.130 --> 07:31.750
But...

07:33.510 --> 07:35.770
That was no human.

07:38.290 --> 07:40.880
If I used my metal manipulation ability, 
they'd find out I'm working undercover.

07:40.880 --> 07:42.720
As I was thinking about that...

07:44.220 --> 07:45.230
Old man!

07:48.180 --> 07:49.680
Are you all right?

07:49.680 --> 07:51.940
Tachihara... Run!

07:51.940 --> 07:55.400
Run while I'm still sane!

08:06.290 --> 08:08.690
What I saw there...

08:11.960 --> 08:15.090
An indiscriminate act of terrorism 
using a contagious ability.

08:15.480 --> 08:16.700
What do you think?

08:17.150 --> 08:19.790
I doubt he's lying or hallucinating.

08:19.790 --> 08:21.620
The Port Mafia has been reporting

08:21.620 --> 08:25.750
one mysterious disappearance after 
another in the past couple hours.

08:26.110 --> 08:28.950
It seems we'll need to contain it quickly.

08:28.950 --> 08:31.050
Nah, it's too late already.

08:31.050 --> 08:33.120
The contagion's spreading too fast.

08:33.120 --> 08:36.700
The only solution is to eradicate 
the special ability itself.

08:36.700 --> 08:40.540
In other words, we'll have to kill 
the Gifted from whom it originates.

08:40.540 --> 08:43.470
But we don't know who that is.

08:43.910 --> 08:45.540
The Armed Detective Agency.

08:46.740 --> 08:51.890
Judging from the timing, it's safe to assume 
it's their next act of global terrorism.

08:53.060 --> 08:53.850
What?

08:53.850 --> 08:58.330
Oh, nothing, it's just that you only 
say anything sensible once a month.

08:58.330 --> 09:01.250
I should mark it down on my calendar.

09:01.250 --> 09:03.730
The Armed Detective Agency, huh?

09:04.850 --> 09:07.030
This will be complicated.

09:07.570 --> 09:10.640
Ever since that live broadcast, 
the situation's been a mess.

09:11.180 --> 09:16.240
Apparently a third of the police in 
Yokohama are siding with the Agency.

09:16.650 --> 09:18.460
How infuriating.

09:18.460 --> 09:22.280
Right. That includes a 
third of the Hunting Dogs.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.480
What?!

09:24.480 --> 09:27.690
I'm just requesting a reassessment 
of the investigation.

09:27.690 --> 09:29.720
The true culprit is out there.

09:29.720 --> 09:30.970
An evil mastermind out there.

09:31.650 --> 09:34.340
The contagious special ability must be
 that mastermind's doing, too.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.810
Please give me permission to investigate!

09:39.130 --> 09:40.310
So he says.

09:41.190 --> 09:42.630
What shall we do, Captain?

09:44.110 --> 09:48.090
I won't permit a search for another culprit.

09:48.350 --> 09:49.690
Captain...

09:49.690 --> 09:54.860
If we're going to stop this contagious ability,
Tachihara, your ability will be critical.

09:55.940 --> 09:57.920
We can't have you leaving now.

09:58.610 --> 10:01.990
I'm honored you think so 
highly of my ability.

10:03.100 --> 10:04.530
Understood.

10:04.530 --> 10:05.650
I'll pursue it no further.

10:07.880 --> 10:10.820
I have a perfect counterproposal, though.

10:11.120 --> 10:13.080
I got this at the Sky Casino.

10:13.510 --> 10:17.330
Let's hand it to the prominent Detective Agency
 sympathizer Vice Superintendent Yasui.

10:18.460 --> 10:20.860
Oh, isn't that the...

10:21.260 --> 10:25.060
The memory drive of the Agency's statements
 regarding the truth behind the incident.

10:25.510 --> 10:27.480
I destroyed it in the Casino,

10:27.480 --> 10:30.350
but I managed to restore it 
using my metal manipulation ability.

10:31.130 --> 10:33.300
Captain, please, grant me permission.

10:34.270 --> 10:36.270
<i>What do I do now?</i>

10:36.270 --> 10:39.680
<i>The video doesn't reveal my identity.</i>

10:40.820 --> 10:46.090
<i>But an inspection may clue them in 
as to the purpose of the contagion.</i>

10:47.190 --> 10:48.290
All right.

10:49.180 --> 10:50.460
I'll allow it.

10:51.380 --> 10:53.520
Yasui-kun and I go way back.

10:53.520 --> 10:55.140
I'll hand it to him.

10:55.990 --> 10:57.840
Are you sure about this, Captain?

10:57.840 --> 11:01.730
The Agency planted that to cause confusion.

11:01.730 --> 11:02.840
It's fine.

11:03.500 --> 11:04.380
Jouno.

11:04.850 --> 11:07.820
The Captain told the 
United Nations secretary

11:07.820 --> 11:10.300
that he was skeptical of the theory that 
the Detective Agency is the culprit.

11:11.550 --> 11:13.580
I see. So that's why.

11:13.820 --> 11:15.470
Hey, Tachihara!

11:15.470 --> 11:18.810
How dare you have the 
captain lend you his ear?!

11:18.810 --> 11:20.670
I'm jealous!

11:20.670 --> 11:24.120
You make me so damn jealous!

11:22.420 --> 11:24.120
Oh, Captain...

11:24.370 --> 11:28.000
The least I can do is let the vice 
superintendent know you'll be coming.

11:31.180 --> 11:32.230
Please do.

11:38.380 --> 11:40.000
<i>Damn Tachihara...</i>

11:52.000 --> 11:54.160
Bram-kun, you have work.

11:55.740 --> 11:58.990
Have your kin bite
Chief Superintendent Yasui.

11:58.990 --> 12:01.210
I request compensation.

12:01.210 --> 12:03.080
I'm bored in my coffin.

12:03.080 --> 12:06.600
Upon my success, you will bring me 
the fruit of future human ingenuity,

12:06.600 --> 12:09.250
the mechanical orchestra that 
they call the "radio."

12:10.650 --> 12:13.440
<i>This will collapse the Detective Agency 
sympathizer organizations.</i>

12:13.440 --> 12:15.110
<i>The plan will continue unhindered.</i>

12:19.960 --> 12:22.560
So <i>that's</i> what's been going on.

12:22.560 --> 12:26.900
Heroes sure are way
beyond my understanding.

12:27.190 --> 12:28.800
Tachihara.

12:28.800 --> 12:30.100
How did you find this place?

12:30.350 --> 12:33.510
The memory drive I gave you 
is a location transmitter.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.400
I seem pretty undercover-ey, don't I?

12:35.930 --> 12:39.230
Were you suspicious of 
me from the beginning?

12:39.230 --> 12:43.550
No. I'm embarrassed to say 
I didn't have the slightest clue.

12:43.850 --> 12:45.990
It was the boss who did.

12:46.640 --> 12:52.300
Right after I returned to the Port Mafia 
infiltration mission, I was called up by the boss.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.130
Boss?

12:56.530 --> 12:58.870
You dropped something, Tachihara-kun.

12:59.200 --> 13:01.330
I was ready to die.

13:01.330 --> 13:02.490
But...

13:02.490 --> 13:05.330
I'm fortunate to have a member of the 
military police under my command.

13:05.950 --> 13:10.670
The next time I get a traffic ticket,
 I'll have to ask you to take it off my record.

13:11.620 --> 13:14.600
I heard everything from the Agency.

13:15.760 --> 13:19.390
That you told Yosano-kun 
that you're a Hunting Dog.

13:19.390 --> 13:25.250
That the tiger boy fought the true mastermind
 of the Decay of the Angels, and lost.

13:25.250 --> 13:27.380
The true mastermind?

13:27.380 --> 13:28.920
So there really is one?!

13:29.760 --> 13:34.170
Tachihara-kun, as you're a member of the 
Port Mafia, I have a mission for you.

13:34.440 --> 13:38.470
Become a double agent and
 defeat the enemy of the world.

13:34.460 --> 13:38.460
<b>Become a double agent and
 defeat the enemy of the world.</b>

13:39.000 --> 13:40.420
I see...

13:40.670 --> 13:43.890
This transmitter was one of 
the Port Mafia's ideas, too.

13:44.370 --> 13:46.620
It also serves as a recorder.

13:47.160 --> 13:50.210
Military police intelligence are 
currently listening to this conversation.

13:50.500 --> 13:52.480
In other words, it's over for you.

13:54.150 --> 13:55.220
I see.

13:55.640 --> 13:56.780
Why?

13:56.780 --> 13:58.110
Why would you do this?

13:58.470 --> 14:01.600
I've taken on so many
 dangerous missions by your order.

14:02.030 --> 14:05.610
I pretended to join the Port Mafia 
and faked emotions,

14:05.610 --> 14:09.280
because I thought your 
orders would let me be me!

14:10.390 --> 14:13.040
You were an outstanding soldier.

14:13.350 --> 14:14.370
No.

14:14.370 --> 14:16.200
I'm not a soldier anymore.

14:16.470 --> 14:19.930
I'll be watching the news of 
your demise in the papers.

14:21.410 --> 14:23.140
My demise?

14:23.880 --> 14:25.970
Why would that happen?

14:26.670 --> 14:29.930
The military police intelligence team 
are secretive and few in number.

14:29.930 --> 14:33.930
I'll order Bram-kun to have everyone in the 
intelligence team bitten and made his kin.

14:34.200 --> 14:37.400
And the plan will go on without a hitch.

14:37.400 --> 14:41.130
Do you think I'll allow that?

14:41.130 --> 14:43.270
You don't stand a chance against me.

14:44.400 --> 14:45.620
Are you sure?

14:45.620 --> 14:49.200
I have a countermeasure against 
your special ability.

14:49.200 --> 14:50.620
The boss and I came up with it.

14:52.200 --> 14:55.460
Tachihara-kun, one more order...

14:55.540 --> 14:59.120
<b>Defeat the enemy of the world</b>

14:55.860 --> 14:59.130
Defeat the enemy of the world.

15:01.790 --> 15:03.970
<i>My orders make me who I am.</i>

15:09.620 --> 15:10.630
<i>And there it is.</i>

15:11.200 --> 15:13.460
<i>The space-time sword Amenogozen.</i>

15:13.460 --> 15:16.800
I'll run this blade through the past you.

15:16.800 --> 15:18.090
That will be your demise!

15:20.340 --> 15:21.890
<i>My blade won't move!</i>

15:22.480 --> 15:25.300
You've forgotten something 
fundamental, captain.

15:25.300 --> 15:28.150
Any fancy sword is still just metal.

15:28.660 --> 15:30.530
It belongs to me!

15:32.820 --> 15:34.600
Do you think you can win a tug-of-war?

15:38.680 --> 15:39.790
Good.

15:39.790 --> 15:41.490
I have more strength!

15:47.560 --> 15:48.670
<i>Damn...</i>

15:49.050 --> 15:51.130
<i>I've let him take Amenogozen!</i>

15:51.650 --> 15:54.670
Your ability to cut the 
past is all powerful.

15:54.670 --> 15:56.000
You have no weakness.

15:56.320 --> 16:01.720
The only response is to steal your 
katana before you can cut the past.

16:02.060 --> 16:04.770
<i>Tachihara's ability is strong.</i>

16:04.770 --> 16:07.570
<i>And it happens to be my arch nemesis.</i>

16:08.250 --> 16:10.810
But my boss also told me...

16:10.810 --> 16:14.210
Whether you're stripped 
naked or on death's door...

16:14.210 --> 16:16.900
Not to ever let my guard down!

16:18.970 --> 16:22.180
<i>He stopped a sword flying at the speed 
of a bullet with his bare hand...</i>

16:22.680 --> 16:23.820
<i>But...</i>

16:26.140 --> 16:27.720
<i>That's exactly what I planned.</i>

16:28.120 --> 16:31.220
<i>He fractured the blade ahead of time!</i>

16:38.780 --> 16:39.760
<i>Shit!</i>

16:39.760 --> 16:42.610
<i>The shard that hit me is 
traveling up my vein!</i>

16:42.980 --> 16:45.320
This was the boss's plan...

16:45.320 --> 16:47.820
I don't care if you're a hero 
who's killed a god before.

16:47.820 --> 16:50.730
If a piece of metal goes through 
your brain or heart, you're dead.

16:51.090 --> 16:52.830
<i>I have to extract the shard.</i>

16:56.590 --> 16:58.610
I've still got a truckload of shards.

16:58.610 --> 16:59.480
<i>What?!</i>

17:00.760 --> 17:03.470
<i>He's trying to escape my ability's range.</i>

17:03.880 --> 17:04.790
Give it up!

17:12.050 --> 17:13.840
There's no point trying to hold it.

17:15.050 --> 17:18.370
It's going deep into your veins.

17:19.970 --> 17:21.560
<i>What is this mark?</i>

17:21.560 --> 17:23.090
<i>The letter T?</i>

17:23.090 --> 17:25.010
Impressive, Tachihara.

17:25.930 --> 17:31.410
Even for a Hunting Dog, cornering me 
on your own is an impressive feat.

17:31.410 --> 17:32.770
I'm not a Hunting Dog.

17:33.180 --> 17:36.280
I'm Tachihara Michizo of the Port Mafia.

17:37.910 --> 17:38.650
But...

17:39.460 --> 17:42.030
I would have been fine as a Hunting Dog.

17:42.630 --> 17:44.240
Why did you betray us?!

17:44.240 --> 17:47.010
Why would someone like you 
do this to the world?!

17:50.330 --> 17:51.640
What?

17:51.640 --> 17:54.730
<i>Amenogozen is still at my hand.</i>

17:54.730 --> 17:56.120
<i>What just happened?</i>

17:59.180 --> 18:01.130
Impressive, Tachihara.

18:03.920 --> 18:05.840
I'd expect no less of my team.

18:06.450 --> 18:07.760
How?

18:08.200 --> 18:11.010
Do you want to know how I defeated you?

18:11.700 --> 18:12.930
Very well.

18:13.310 --> 18:15.440
This is part of your training 
as my subordinate.

18:17.440 --> 18:24.210
When I first sent Amenogozen into the past,
it wasn't to attack your past self.

18:25.510 --> 18:30.410
I sent the tip of the blade into the past 
and left a secret message signaling danger

18:30.710 --> 18:32.610
to my past self.

18:33.060 --> 18:37.320
Having seen that, my past self 
guessed at my future situation.

18:37.660 --> 18:40.130
And, in turn,

18:41.850 --> 18:44.350
I stabbed Amenogozen into the future.

18:44.950 --> 18:47.310
In other words, I was never running away.

18:47.720 --> 18:51.140
I was guiding you to my note.

18:51.560 --> 18:54.340
<i>You sent information into the past?</i>

18:54.340 --> 18:55.840
<i>You've got to be kidding me.</i>

18:55.840 --> 18:57.870
<i>If you can send information 
into the past...</i>

18:58.300 --> 19:01.170
<i>You can effectively predict the future!</i>

19:01.730 --> 19:03.330
<i>No one can defeat him.</i>

19:03.650 --> 19:06.030
<i>He's literally invincible.</i>

19:14.510 --> 19:18.000
Without sight, you'll have 
trouble manipulating metal.

19:18.000 --> 19:18.970
Kill me!

19:19.580 --> 19:24.260
The Port Mafia don't beg 
pathetically for their lives.

19:24.870 --> 19:26.710
I'm sick of hearing that.

19:27.150 --> 19:31.110
Everyone seems to think I kill for pleasure.

19:31.610 --> 19:37.030
I am one of the Decay of Angels,
bringer of the five signs of the angels' deaths.

19:37.500 --> 19:40.860
Tachihara, you are no angel.

19:41.530 --> 19:44.200
Do you know who "angel" refers to?

19:44.630 --> 19:48.730
Sorry, I skipped literature class.

19:49.490 --> 19:54.560
An angel is one who, without tarnishing 
their own hands, without getting in the mud,

19:54.560 --> 19:59.590
sends those under them into the battlefield,

19:59.590 --> 20:01.910
enjoying wealth and pleasure 
without accountability.

20:02.490 --> 20:04.840
One who holds the reins of the people.

20:04.840 --> 20:07.880
One who is beyond the reach of anything common.

20:08.300 --> 20:10.880
Therefore, "angel" means a false ruler.

20:10.880 --> 20:13.380
Their disregard bears war.

20:13.840 --> 20:16.430
They must atone by death,

20:16.790 --> 20:19.690
and their deaths must be painful.

20:20.170 --> 20:22.870
That is why we wield our blades.

20:22.870 --> 20:25.650
That's your criminal motive?

20:26.450 --> 20:28.440
It's a criminal motive for now.

20:29.070 --> 20:32.790
By next year, it'll be the preface 
to a hero's autobiography.

20:34.800 --> 20:36.220
By the power of the page.

20:36.760 --> 20:39.740
Now, then, I have matters to attend to.

20:39.740 --> 20:43.430
I must control half of every nation's 
population before the final phase of the plan,

20:43.430 --> 20:47.290
in which I use the other side of the page.

20:48.090 --> 20:49.250
Half?

20:49.930 --> 20:51.920
Do you doubt I can do it?

20:53.460 --> 20:59.570
Bram-kun, how many days will it take to turn 
half of each nation's military into vampires?

20:59.570 --> 21:01.300
Four days would suffice.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.300
Four days?

21:04.300 --> 21:05.740
That's impossible.

21:05.740 --> 21:07.610
Physically impossible.

21:07.970 --> 21:11.130
There's no special ability 
that contagious.

21:11.130 --> 21:12.390
You're correct.

21:13.140 --> 21:15.760
If there were, the world 
would have ended long ago.

21:16.770 --> 21:22.050
Though, that's assuming the 
ability of <i>one</i> Gifted.

21:22.640 --> 21:23.540
No!

21:23.810 --> 21:28.450
<i>The captain's ability allows him to increase 
the ability of his weapon by a hundred times.</i>

21:28.450 --> 21:31.120
I care for my men, Tachihara.

21:32.120 --> 21:35.220
I hope you'll continue to make 
yourself useful under my command.

21:40.250 --> 21:42.070
As a vampire!

21:42.070 --> 21:43.820
Fuck!

21:48.070 --> 21:51.700
<b>Four days until X Day.</b>

21:51.960 --> 22:00.130
<i>International flight RSF aboard al-Haram Air 
Flight 97 is now boarding all passengers.</i>

22:00.130 --> 22:01.550
Have a nice flight.

22:01.550 --> 22:03.300
Please watch your step.

22:07.800 --> 22:12.100
<b>The contagious ability spreads overseas</b>

22:11.180 --> 22:12.100
Don't shoot!

22:12.570 --> 22:13.940
We're on your side!

22:14.730 --> 22:19.650
<b>Nares
Republic</b>

22:14.730 --> 22:19.650
<b>Central
Command</b>

22:15.210 --> 22:17.090
These are our headquarters.

22:17.090 --> 22:19.650
Such an armed attack on a 
central organ is unprecedented.

22:20.110 --> 22:23.240
The Ministry of Defense 
is ordering us to disarm.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.530
We absolutely cannot!

22:24.840 --> 22:26.990
The fall of the command room beyond this door

22:26.990 --> 22:29.570
is tantamount to the loss of 
this republic's sovereignty.

22:32.330 --> 22:33.360
Your highness!

22:33.840 --> 22:34.690
No, sir!

22:34.690 --> 22:35.820
Please stand back!

22:35.820 --> 22:39.040
Your highness, I promise I will 
bring you back to the palace.

22:39.510 --> 22:41.210
I only ask for a little more patience.

22:47.460 --> 22:48.510
Chairperson!

22:49.110 --> 22:51.490
The Nares Republic Ministry of Defense

22:51.490 --> 22:54.300
has sent a notice of withdrawal 
to the Security Council.

22:54.750 --> 22:57.740
We can't contact the Nares ambassador 
to the United Nations, either.

22:57.740 --> 22:59.510
This is clearly a crisis.

22:59.810 --> 23:01.420
Leave it on my desk.

23:01.420 --> 23:02.230
I'll read it later.

23:02.230 --> 23:03.130
But...

23:03.130 --> 23:04.930
I need you to see this immediately!

23:05.370 --> 23:06.700
One at a time.

23:07.590 --> 23:11.780
<i>A new age of terror, without borders and 
whose method of attack is indecipherable...</i>

23:12.820 --> 23:15.570
<i>The hero's prediction was correct.</i>

23:15.570 --> 23:18.070
What will you be doing on the eve of
the world's destruction at the hands

23:18.070 --> 23:20.740
of the new-age terrorist organization
that is the Decay of Angels?

23:21.240 --> 23:24.460
Will you spend your last
moments enjoying a feast?

23:24.770 --> 23:25.680
No!

23:26.130 --> 23:28.420
We won't let evil have its way!

23:29.050 --> 23:32.820
We'll call on the Knight Commander 
of the Order of the Clock Tower

23:32.800 --> 23:35.970
to unleash One Order: 
the special ability weapon.

23:35.970 --> 23:39.970
Episode 55

23:35.970 --> 23:39.970
<i>At the Port in the Sky
(Part 1)</i>
